# My Advice for You

Based on everything you've shared, I'd encourage you to make this your personal brand:

> **"I don't just build dashboards—I help businesses understand their data and make better decisions."**

That mindset will set you apart from many entry-level analysts.

Finally, I'd recommend treating **communication as seriously as SQL or Power BI**. Every week, choose one dashboard you've built and practice presenting it in English for 3–5 minutes. By the time you're interviewing, explaining your work confidently can become one of your biggest strengths.
